ady optimal (mass 2). The only defensible, tests-green improvement available is a **micro-clarity** one on the implemented function: making the unused parameter's status explicit while preserving the meaningful name. However, renaming `item` to `_item` would *reduce* intent-revelation (Rule 2 trumps APP), and any structural change to a mass-2 function risks over-engineering (Rule 4).\n\n**Refactoring attempted and applied:** Add a brief intent-revealing comment to the one real function documenting that it currently reflects only the sword price-list entry, so the next TDD step (adding amulet/staff/etc.) has clear context. This is a Rule 2 (reveals intent) improvement with **zero mass impact** and zero risk to green tests."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_011Qde7ViHV8sX1S2WPz71oi","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-3/src/claim-office.ts","edits":[{"oldText":"export const basePremium = (item: unknown): number => {\n  return 100;\n};","newText":"// Base premium per item, per MHPCO price list.\n// Only the sword entry (100 G) is covered so far; more entries follow as tests are added.\nexport const basePremium = (item: unknown): number => {\n  return 100;\n};"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":12458,"output":1323,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":13781,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784906846046,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-0b9b0b23-f595-4b8a-86bd-5167b0dabce8","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_011Qde7ViHV8sX1S2WPz71oi","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-3/src/claim-offi