s that intent more directly.\n- Rule 4 / APP: The three assignments dominate the mass. Converting to a pure summed expression eliminates all mutation.\n\n### Step 4: Implement (one change)\nConvert the mutable accumulator to a summed expression of modifier terms."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01MjABN3b6bpUBm7UNGF3yrm","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-3/src/claim-office.ts","edits":[{"oldText":"const surchargeRateForItem = (item: Item): number => {\n  let rate = 0;\n  if (item.cursed) rate += CURSE_SURCHARGE;\n  if ((item.enchantment ?? 0) >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD)\n    rate += HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE;\n  return rate;\n};","newText":"const isHighEnchantment = (item: Item): boolean =>\n  (item.enchantment ?? 0) >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD;\n\nconst surchargeRateForItem = (item: Item): number =>\n  (item.cursed ? CURSE_SURCHARGE : 0) +\n  (isHighEnchantment(item) ? HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE : 0);"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":4744,"output":2634,"cacheRead":9696,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":17074,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907689499,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-334e8916-e9b1-4027-8cb6-cd2d44ec389f","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01MjABN3b6bpUBm7UNGF3yrm","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-3/src/claim-office.ts."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n  61 const HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD = 5;\n  62 \n  63 // The total surcharge rate is the sum of every applicable per-item modifier.\n  64 // Add new item modifiers (e.g. high-enchantment) as further terms he